{"html":"<h1 id=\"core-language-benchmark\">Core language benchmark</h1>\n<p>1 compile runs, 1 fresh-process runs, and 100 raw runtime runs. Values shown as mean ± sample standard deviation in ms. Compile warmups: 1. Process warmups: 1. Raw runtime warmups: 10.</p>\n<p>Matched rows keep the same algorithm. Idiomatic rows allow each ecosystem's normal optimized implementation; inspect the linked source before comparing them.</p>\n<h2 id=\"compile-time-ms\">Compile time (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>23589.496 ± 0.000</td><td>354.571 ± 0.000</td><td>103.304 ± 0.000</td><td>200.115 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>50.498 ± 0.000</td><td>113.466 ± 0.000</td><td>87.705 ± 0.000</td><td>188.708 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>115.519 ± 0.000</td><td>280.581 ± 0.000</td><td>94.898 ± 0.000</td><td>189.797 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23973.716 ± 0.000</td><td>480.070 ± 0.000</td><td>142.286 ± 0.000</td><td>249.018 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23742.342 ± 0.000</td><td>481.853 ± 0.000</td><td>142.885 ± 0.000</td><td>246.705 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"runtime-ms\">Runtime (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>47.903 ± 0.000</td><td>17.022 ± 0.000</td><td>16.392 ± 0.000</td><td>16.182 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>10.996 ± 0.000</td><td>22.376 ± 0.000</td><td>19.133 ± 0.000</td><td>20.918 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>5.254 ± 0.000</td><td>5.634 ± 0.000</td><td>4.396 ± 0.000</td><td>6.009 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>60.895 ± 0.000</td><td>41.011 ± 0.000</td><td>36.123 ± 0.000</td><td>38.180 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>60.803 ± 0.000</td><td>40.065 ± 0.000</td><td>36.502 ± 0.000</td><td>38.234 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-internal-compiler-core-time-including-optimizer-ms\">VKF internal compiler-core time, including optimizer (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>23584.434 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>46.722 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>110.958 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23967.077 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23736.010 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-empirical-optimizer-time-within-compilation-ms\">VKF empirical optimizer time within compilation (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>109.839 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>36.950 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>23.141 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>155.514 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>154.905 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"raw-kernel-runtime-ms\">Raw kernel runtime (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>46.457 ± 2.086</td><td>14.542 ± 0.045</td><td>14.317 ± 0.262</td><td>14.337 ± 0.027</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>8.863 ± 0.037</td><td>19.532 ± 0.373</td><td>16.744 ± 0.136</td><td>18.767 ± 0.240</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>3.458 ± 0.119</td><td>3.159 ± 0.022</td><td>2.420 ± 0.011</td><td>4.051 ± 0.029</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>58.503 ± 0.135</td><td>36.772 ± 0.198</td><td>34.126 ± 1.446</td><td>35.765 ± 0.738</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>58.512 ± 0.152</td><td>36.824 ± 0.219</td><td>33.904 ± 0.788</td><td>35.601 ± 0.064</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-raw-kernel-runtime-ratio\">VKF raw-kernel runtime ratio</h2>\n<p>VKF time divided by the peer time on the same pinned CPU; below 1× means VKF is faster.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=